Package: oxfordiar
Type: Package
Title: Common Oxfordia R Runtime
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Description: Common runtime for Oxfordia R packages. Provides
    authentication helpers, target definitions, graph-path builders,
    data shortcut types, and low-level federated query execution used
    by statistic-specific packages.
